      "chunk_id": "0c6b2deed018_1",
      "doc_id": "0c6b2deed018",
      "text": "When I turn the phone on it was fully charged and I want to say I was probably on both phones for about 30 minutes each setting them up which I had no problem setting up either but I had noticed that the battery life in 30 minutes a drain to 50% or maybe less. It’s not a big issue for me considering it’s for my seven and six year olds and they don’t need to be on the phone all day LOL but if this is the phone you’re looking for an adult for then I would probably say this wouldn’t be for you. But overall great quality on the phone yhe battery just needs to be better.",
