      "chunk_id": "5f9ebf9d9665_6",
      "doc_id": "5f9ebf9d9665",
      "text": "It was still destroying expectations at 8%. I feel confidant that would have took me another 2 hours. So there you have it... Finally, a smartphone that can last a full day. Granted, my day is a bit longer than most, 18.5 hours. But it fought the good fight and made it. Now, before I start getting messages saying: \"Oh James, the battery is still new, of course you'll get this battery life.\" Or \"Well, you don't use it as much as me.\" Let me just say, this is as accurate as I can make it. My schedule is very close to the same every day, and this phone is performing almost as well day 10, as day 2.",
