      "chunk_id": "fe0ff96a58e8_0",
      "doc_id": "fe0ff96a58e8",
      "text": "Battery won't hold a charge and overheats quickly. I had a previous version of this phone for my daughter and it worked great. She broke the screen on her old one so I bought a refurbished replacement. It was one issue after another from the start. The biggest issue is the battery. It will charge but the battery will drain to 1% in a matter of minutes once off the charger. Definitely unhappy with my purchase.",
